    "problemName": "super-egg-drop",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def superEggDrop(self, k: int, n: int) -> int:\r\n        @cache\r\n        def dfs(i: int, j: int) -> int:\r\n            if i < 1:\r\n                return 0\r\n            if j == 1:\r\n                return i\r\n            l, r = 1, i\r\n            while l < r:\r\n                mid = (l + r + 1) >> 1\r\n                a = dfs(mid - 1, j - 1)\r\n                b = dfs(i - mid, j)\r\n                if a <= b:\r\n                    l = mid\r\n                else:\r\n                    r = mid - 1\r\n            return max(dfs(l - 1, j - 1), dfs(i - l, j)) + 1\r\n\r\n        return dfs(n, k)",
